# External staging scheduler example. This file is not installed automatically.
# Replace /srv/indianxtrade with a dedicated checkout containing npm dependencies
# and Node >=22.19.0. Ensure cron's PATH contains the matching node and npm.
# Provision runner environment/permissions as described in
# docs/PERFORMANCE-PHASE-4-RECEIPTS.md. Never put credentials in this crontab.
# The existing command authenticates to the permitted staging worker; it refuses
# disabled/production runner configuration and reports non-2xx/timeout failures.
# Repeated/overlapping runs share existing durable outbox claims and retry fences.
* * * * * cd "/srv/indianxtrade" && npm run operations:run -- --run
